## shadcn / Radix

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` — Button, Card, Field, Input, Select
- Use `Field` + `FieldLabel` + `Input`/`Select` for forms
- Use `cn()` from `@/utils/style` for conditional classes
- Prefer composition over custom wrappers
